---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span class="text-white">Terms of</span> <span class="text-gold">Service</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="page-kicker">Last updated: November 2, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="nugzz-card p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using officialnugzzcrew.com (the Site) and any related tools or features, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Site. These Terms apply to all visitors, including those who sign in with Google/YouTube or link a Discord account.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Official Nugzz Crew provides community resources, tools, and information focused on GTA Online, including glitch methods, DMO-related content, custom generators, emblem tools, maps, and related community features. Optional account sign-in enables account linking for live stream chat, command features, and DMO ticket integration.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">3. Accounts & Sign-In</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>You may optionally sign in using Google/YouTube OAuth and link a Discord account. By doing so, you authorize us to receive the basic profile information described in our <a href="/privacy" class="text-gold hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your Google and Discord accounts. You must not share access or allow others to use your linked account on the Site.</li>
          <li>We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or engage in abuse.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Use the Site or tools for any illegal purpose</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorized access to the Site or related systems</li>
          <li>Harass, threaten, or abuse other community members</li>
          <li>Upload or distribute malware or harmful content</li>
          <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation</li>
          <li>Scrape or systematically extract data in a way that harms the Site</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">Content related to GTA Online methods is provided for informational and educational purposes within the community. Users are solely responsible for their own actions in-game and any consequences that may result from Rockstar Games or other platforms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All original content, tools, branding, and design on the Site are owned by Official Nugzz Crew unless otherwise noted. You may not copy, reproduce, or redistribute Site materials for commercial purposes without permission. Third-party trademarks (including Rockstar, GTA, Discord, Google, YouTube) remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">6. Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>The Site and all tools are provided “as is” and “as available” without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee that tools will be free of errors, that methods will remain functional, or that use of any information will not result in account actions by game platforms. Use of glitch-related content is at your own risk.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Official Nugzz Crew shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the Site, tools, or linked account features.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms at any time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a new “Last updated” date. Continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-white font-header uppercase tracking-wide text-lg mb-2">9. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these Terms? Use the <a href="/contact" class="text-gold hover:underline">contact form</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm pt-4">Official Nugzz Crew • officialnugzzcrew.com • Built for The Fam Bam</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
